{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.23", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.11", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.2"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the client's order: header out, header in, open out, open in. The table's START sends HDR, HDR_SENT receives HDR, HDR_EXCH sends OPEN, and OPEN_SENT receives OPEN, which is the whole path from START to OPENED", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_SENT", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 16}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "client", "type": "string"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000001602000000005310c00901a106736572766572", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPENED", "status": "admitted"}}], "vector": "exchange-client-open"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.23", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.11", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.2"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the server's order, which the table permits equally: it may wait for the incoming header before sending its own, so HDR_RCVD comes first and OPEN_RCVD precedes OPENED", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "HDR_RCVD", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001602000000005310c00901a106636c69656e74", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_RCVD", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OPENED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 16}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "server", "type": "string"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}], "vector": "exchange-server-open"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.23", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.1", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.2"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "a pipelined open: the open is sent before the partner's header arrives, so HDR_SENT sends OPEN into OPEN_PIPE, whose legal receives are HDR, and the matching header then lands in OPEN_SENT", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_PIPE", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 16}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "client", "type": "string"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001602000000005310c00901a106736572766572", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPENED", "status": "admitted"}}], "vector": "exchange-pipelined-open"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.23", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.5", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.6", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.9"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the pipelined close: OPEN_PIPE sends the close into OC_PIPE, which sends nothing at all, and the partner's header and open walk it through CLOSE_PIPE and CLOSE_SENT to END \u2014 the table's `-` column on the send side", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_PIPE", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 16}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "client", "type": "string"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OC_PIPE", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 24}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "CLOSE_PIPE", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001602000000005310c00901a106736572766572", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "CLOSE_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000000c0200000000531845", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "END", "status": "admitted"}}], "vector": "exchange-pipelined-close"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.5", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.6"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "an orderly close we initiate: OPENED sends CLOSE into CLOSE_SENT, whose legal sends are `-`, and the partner's close ends the connection", "start": "OPENED", "steps": [{"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "CLOSE_SENT", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 24}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000000c0200000000531845", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "END", "status": "admitted"}}], "vector": "exchange-close-sent-first"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.5", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.6", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.9"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the partner closes first: OPENED receives CLOSE into CLOSE_RCVD, which receives nothing (`-`) but may still send, and our close ends it", "start": "OPENED", "steps": [{"bytes": "0000000c0200000000531845", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "CLOSE_RCVD", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "END", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 24}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}], "vector": "exchange-close-received-first"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.11", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:version-negotiation.13"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "an unacceptable protocol id: the octets are a perfectly good protocol header, and the refusal is that this peer does not speak that protocol", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515002010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "unsupported", "state": "END", "status": "refused"}, "note": "protocol id two is the TLS layer's; this peer speaks protocol id zero and three, so the request is for a protocol it does not speak"}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "illegalState", "state": "END", "status": "refused"}, "note": "END's legal receives are `-`: the connection is over, so not even a header arrives on it"}], "vector": "exchange-header-protocol-id-unsupported"}
