{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.5", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.1"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "OPEN_SENT's legal sends are `**`: a close within the limits every implementation must accept may be pipelined before the partner's open arrives, and the state diagram's OPEN_SENT --S:CLOSE--> CLOSE_PIPE says where it lands", "start": "OPEN_SENT", "steps": [{"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "CLOSE_PIPE", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 24}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "illegalState", "state": "CLOSE_PIPE", "status": "refused"}, "note": "CLOSE_PIPE's legal sends are `-`: the close has been written, and nothing is written after it", "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 24}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}], "vector": "exchange-conforming-frame-in-open-sent"}
