{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.23", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.10", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.1", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:performatives/type:open/field:channel-max.1", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:performatives/type:open/field:channel-max.2"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the same frame on channel one: refused while the peer's open is still unknown because the a priori limit is channel zero, and admitted in OPENED once the peer's own open has raised the channel maximum \u2014 the one place the table's `**` differs from its `*`", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_PIPE", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 16}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "server", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 4294967295}, {"type": "ushort", "value": 65535}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "limit", "state": "OPEN_PIPE", "status": "refused"}, "note": "before any explicit negotiation the maximum channel number is zero, so a pipelined frame on channel one is not known a priori to conform", "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 17}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001f02000000005310c01204a1067365727665724070ffffffff60ffff", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPENED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OPENED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 17}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 1, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}], "vector": "exchange-pipelined-channel-limit"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.23", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.1", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:performatives/type:open/field:max-frame-size.1", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:performatives/type:open/field:max-frame-size.2"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the same oversized frame: refused in OPEN_PIPE and admitted in OPENED, because the peer's open replaced the a priori maximum frame size with its own", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_PIPE", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 16}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "server", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 4294967295}, {"type": "ushort", "value": 65535}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "limit", "state": "OPEN_PIPE", "status": "refused"}, "note": "the frame totals one octet more than MIN-MAX-FRAME-SIZE, the size both peers must accept and the only size known before the partner's open arrives", "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 17}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "payload": "", "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001f02000000005310c01204a1067365727665724070ffffffff60ffff", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPENED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OPENED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 17}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "payload": "", "type": "00"}}], "vector": "exchange-pipelined-frame-size-limit"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:performatives/type:open/field:max-frame-size.1", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:performatives/type:open/field:max-frame-size.2"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the receive side of the same limit, where it is this peer's own open that sets the bound and the consequence is the error-triggered close", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_PIPE", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 16}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "client", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}, {"type": "uint", "value": 512}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001f02000000005310c01204a1067365727665724070ffffffff60ffff", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPENED", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "limit", "state": "DISCARDING", "status": "refused"}, "note": "this peer announced a maximum frame size of MIN-MAX-FRAME-SIZE, and the partner sent one octet more: a peer that receives an oversized frame must close the connection with the framing-error error-code"}], "vector": "exchange-oversized-frame-received"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.1", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.4", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.6", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.7", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl/type:sasl-outcome.1", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#picture.3", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#picture.6"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the SASL client's side of ANONYMOUS: protocol id three, the header exchange again, the mechanisms the server announces, our init, the outcome, and then \u2014 because a successful outcome establishes the layer and the peers must exchange protocol headers again \u2014 protocol id zero, the header exchange, and open", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515003010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "414d515003010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001902010000005340c00c01a309414e4f4e594d4f5553", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 65}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "ANONYMOUS", "type": "symbol"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "01"}}, {"bytes": "0000001002010000005344c003015000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "START", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_SENT", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 16}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "client", "type": "string"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}, {"bytes": "0000001602000000005310c00901a106736572766572", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPENED", "status": "admitted"}}], "vector": "exchange-sasl-anonymous-to-open"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.1", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.4", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.6", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.7", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl/type:sasl-outcome.1", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#picture.3"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the SASL server's side of the same exchange: it announces the mechanisms and sends the outcome half of the dialogue, and the protocol header exchange after the outcome happens in the same order a plain server's does", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515003010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "HDR_RCVD", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "414d515003010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 64}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "ANONYMOUS", "type": "symbol"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "01"}}, {"bytes": "0000001902010000005341c00c01a309414e4f4e594d4f5553", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "START", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 68}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"type": "ubyte", "value": 0}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "01"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "HDR_RCVD", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001602000000005310c00901a106636c69656e74", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "OPEN_RCVD", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "OPENED", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 16}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "server", "type": "string"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}], "vector": "exchange-sasl-anonymous-server"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.6", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl/type:sasl-init/field:mechanism.2", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#picture.6"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "a mechanism the peer did not announce: the clause requires the receiving peer to close, and the close-code it names has no value in the generated choice table, so the refusal carries the one connection-error the artifact does use and the reason class says what was unsupported", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515003010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "HDR_RCVD", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "414d515003010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 64}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "ANONYMOUS", "type": "symbol"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "01"}}, {"bytes": "0000001502010000005341c00801a305504c41494e", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "unsupported", "state": "END", "status": "refused"}, "note": "this peer announced ANONYMOUS and nothing else, so an init naming PLAIN selects a mechanism it does not support. The layer is not established, so there is no AMQP close to write: the transport is cut, which is END"}], "vector": "exchange-sasl-mechanism-not-offered"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.7", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl/type:sasl-init/field:mechanism.2", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#picture.6"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "the mechanism comparison the symbol type forces: the same letters in another case are a different symbol and therefore a mechanism the peer did not offer", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515003010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "HDR_RCVD", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "414d515003010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}, "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 64}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "ANONYMOUS", "type": "symbol"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "01"}}, {"bytes": "0000001902010000005341c00c01a309616e6f6e796d6f7573", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "unsupported", "state": "END", "status": "refused"}, "note": "a mechanism is a symbol, and a symbol is compared octet for octet: lower-case anonymous is not ANONYMOUS, and no clause anywhere makes mechanism names case-insensitive"}], "vector": "exchange-sasl-mechanism-case-sensitive"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.1", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.4"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "a SASL frame offered before the header exchange: the layer does not exist yet", "start": "START", "steps": [{"direction": "send", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "illegalState", "state": "START", "status": "refused"}, "note": "START's legal send is the protocol header, and the SASL layer is established by a header with protocol id three before any SASL frame", "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 64}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "ANONYMOUS", "type": "symbol"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "01"}}, {"bytes": "414d515003010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}], "vector": "exchange-sasl-frame-before-header"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.1", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.4", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.2"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "an AMQP performative inside the SASL layer, which is the layer transition rule the security section states and the corpus can observe", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515003010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_SENT", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "414d515003010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "illegalState", "state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "refused"}, "note": "the SASL dialogue is not finished, so the AMQP layer's open is not a frame of this layer: the outcome must arrive and the protocol headers be exchanged again", "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 16}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [{"text": "client", "type": "string"}], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}], "vector": "exchange-amqp-frame-in-sasl-layer"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.4", "amqp-core-security-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:security/section:sasl.1"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "a SASL frame in the AMQP layer, refused in the receive direction where the consequence is the error-triggered close", "start": "START", "steps": [{"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"state": "HDR_RCVD", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "414d515000010000", "direction": "send", "expect": {"state": "HDR_EXCH", "status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000001902010000005340c00c01a309414e4f4e594d4f5553", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "illegalState", "state": "DISCARDING", "status": "refused"}, "note": "this exchange is the AMQP layer's: HDR_EXCH's legal receive is OPEN, and a SASL frame is not it"}], "vector": "exchange-sasl-frame-in-amqp-layer"}
{"clauses": ["amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.24", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#picture.10", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.16", "amqp-core-transport-v1.0-os.xml#amqp:transport/section:connections.6"], "kind": "exchange", "note": "DISCARDING receives `*` and answers nothing \u2014 incoming frames are silently discarded until the partner's close \u2014 while writing is over", "start": "DISCARDING", "steps": [{"bytes": "0000000c0200000000531145", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"status": "admitted"}}, {"bytes": "0000000c0200000000531145", "direction": "receive", "expect": {"status": "admitted"}}, {"direction": "send", "expect": {"condition": "amqp:connection:framing-error", "reason": "illegalState", "state": "DISCARDING", "status": "refused"}, "note": "DISCARDING's legal sends are `-`: the close has already been written, and nothing is written after it", "value": {"body": [{"descriptor": {"type": "ulong", "value": 24}, "type": "described", "value": {"items": [], "type": "list"}}], "channel": 0, "doff": 2, "type": "00"}}], "vector": "exchange-discarding-ignores-frames"}
